CM_ SG_ 1793 UNK_106_1 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.003 per cycle, 2 distinct values 0..1. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.14.";
CM_ SG_ 1793 UNK_107_1 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.013 per cycle, 2 distinct values 0..1. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.24. Coasting-flag candidate: about 0.02 in settled life, 0.5-0.66 just before deletion (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1793 CONST_108_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1793 MOVE_STATE "Movement state. 0 = moving away / same direction, 2 = moving toward (oncoming), 1 and 3 = not clearly moving (1 vs 3 unresolved). Pre-registered test on unseen segments: value 0 had over-ground speed > 0.5 m/s on 99.65% of rows, value 2 < -0.5 m/s on 99.88%, values 1/3 |v| < 2 m/s on 89.5% (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1793 UNK_111_4 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.008 per cycle, 10 distinct values 0..9. Strongest correlation: dRel r=-0.53.";
CM_ SG_ 1793 UNK_115_8 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.052 per cycle, 26 distinct values 0..178. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.27.";
