CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_168_10 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.066 per cycle, 3 distinct values 0..1023. Strongest correlation: abs_yRel r=+0.14.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_178_3 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_181_1 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.071 per cycle, 2 distinct values 0..1. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=+0.34.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_182_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_183_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.009 per cycle, 24 distinct values 26..73. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.20.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_190_10 "Constant 1 (0x1) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_200_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.023 per cycle, 16 distinct values 0..127. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.45.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_207_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_208_6 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.017 per cycle, 20 distinct values 0..63. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.38.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_214_2 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_216_6 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.150 per cycle, 34 distinct values 3..49. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.23. Size / class candidate: camera vehicle height partial rho 0.44-0.63, truck/bus 0.35-0.42; width on A/C. Compare ARS4-B Length / dZ (6 bits) (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_222_2 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_224_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.344 per cycle, 127 distinct values 1..127. Strongest correlation: dRel r=+0.80. Uncertainty candidate: scales with range (r~0.8), falls with age at fixed range (rho -0.29 to -0.36), larger when range steps are noisier, rises before deletion. Weak near-range error indicator; does not single out excursions.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_231_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_232_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.096 per cycle, 72 distinct values 0..127. Strongest correlation: abs_yRel r=+0.60. Lateral-uncertainty candidate: scales with |yRel| (r~0.6), falls with age at fixed range (rho -0.50 to -0.59).";
CM_ SG_ 1797 PER_TRACK_239_1 "Constant within a track, differs between tracks (2 values 0..1): object attribute candidate, unverified. Strongest correlation: abs_yRel r=+0.09.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_240_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.364 per cycle, 127 distinct values 1..127. Strongest correlation: dRel r=+0.80. Velocity-uncertainty candidate (like ARS408 VrelLong_rms): scales with range, falls with age, rises before deletion. Flags velocity glitches: stratified AUC 0.65 / 0.85 (discovery / confirmation) against clean labels where native vRel disagrees with both the radar ACC target (0x235) and vision (docs/15). Decoded as vel_unc_code.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_247_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_248_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.116 per cycle, 97 distinct values 0..127. Strongest correlation: abs_yRel r=+0.56. Uncertainty candidate: scales with |yRel| (r~0.56), falls with age at fixed range (rho -0.70 to -0.75).";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_255_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_256_5 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.177 per cycle, 30 distinct values 0..30. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.72. Existence / confidence candidate: rises with age at fixed range (rho +0.86 to +0.90), drops about 1.5 codes before deletion. Compare ARS4-B ProbExist (5 bits).";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_261_3 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_264_4 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.100 per cycle, 16 distinct values 0..15. Strongest correlation: age r=-0.81. 4 live bits by carry chain (bit 268 constant). Young tracks: counts down with age (13 at age 2 to ~5 at age 80). Settled tracks: values 1-4 depend on range (4 ~10 m, 3 ~12 m, 1 ~30 m, 2 ~47 m), consistent with a near-scan / far-scan measurement state (unconfirmed semantics). Value 1 is more common during velocity glitches (stratified AUC 0.69 / 0.63).";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_268_4 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1797 UNK_272_5 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.095 per cycle, 17 distinct values 2..18. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.30. Size / class candidate: camera vehicle height partial rho 0.41-0.71, width 0.36-0.69, truck/bus 0.24-0.39 (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1797 CONST_277_11 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ BO_ 1798 "Reassembled 0x80 object slot 6 (record bytes 233-268), sent only when occupied. Little-endian bit field: bit 0 = LSB of slot byte 0.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 STATE_CODE "Raw lifecycle state. Measured/predicted semantics not proved; not an accuracy gate.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 SLOT_INDEX_CODE "Physical slot index or 63 in unallocated-form headers; verified against slot positions. Not class or reference point.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 UNK_8_6 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.103 per cycle, 32 distinct values 30..62. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.55. Ramps up with age and saturates at 62; tracks range and scenario, not measured error.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 ONCOMING_FLAG "1 = oncoming now or earlier in the track life (persists after an oncoming object slows). Pre-registered test on unseen segments: over-ground speed < 0 on 100% of flagged rows, 88.5% of objects approaching faster than 2 m/s flagged (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1798 CONST_15_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 SCORE_CODE "Bounded score-like byte, not calibrated confidence or percent. Value 100 does not guarantee accurate geometry or velocity.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 AGE "Track age in radar cycles (~60 ms): 1 at birth, saturates at 126; 0 = slot being retired (geometry is the previous occupant's). A restart is a new track. Tracks younger than ~60 carry unconverged range and velocity.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 CONST_31_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 DREL "Longitudinal distance forward of the radar, m. 1/16 m, zero code 160 (exactly -10 m). Camera ground contact at 5-25 m: slope 0.99-1.00 on three drives, zero within 0.2 m (0.7 m on a hilly drive). Settled tracks walk by metres record to record at 40 m+; young tracks can be far off.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 YREL_LEFT "Lateral offset, LEFT positive (openpilot yRel), m. 1/64 m, offset binary around 2048. Cartesian (constant across range), not an angle. Correct side 97.9-99.3% on held-out drives; scale bounded to about +/-10%. |code-2048| >= 2000 is a sentinel.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 UNK_56_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.355 per cycle, 84 distinct values 4..96. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.30. Size / class candidate: per-track median follows camera vehicle height (partial rho 0.48-0.61 at fixed range) and truck/bus class (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1798 CONST_63_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 VLONG_OVER_GROUND "Longitudinal velocity OVER GROUND, m/s. 0.15 m/s/code, zero 510.5. vRel = this - ego speed. Radar-only scale check (own range slope vs GPS ego) gives 0.150/0.149/0.153 on three drives. Beats zero and range differencing against a camera reference, but has unflagged ~1 s excursions at range. Unsettled for age < ~60.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 VLAT_OVER_GROUND_PROV "Lateral velocity over ground, LEFT positive (sign confirmed). Scale NOT pinned: the factor shown (0.15) is a placeholder. Radar-only estimates from its own lateral position change range 0.097-0.147 m/s per code across data sets, and the pre-registered test was unverified. See docs/14.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 ALONG_LIKE_84 "Acceleration-like, zero code 511 at standstill. Follows the VLONG change with a ~0.5 s lag, so it cannot flag or lead a velocity excursion. Radar-only scale about 0.04 m/s^2 per code on most data but drive-dependent (0.03-0.11); centred codes (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1798 CONST_94_2 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 UNK_96 "Unnamed 10-bit carry chain centred near 511; no relation to velocity or range error on three drives.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 UNK_106_1 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.003 per cycle, 2 distinct values 0..1. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.14.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 UNK_107_1 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.013 per cycle, 2 distinct values 0..1. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.24. Coasting-flag candidate: about 0.02 in settled life, 0.5-0.66 just before deletion (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1798 CONST_108_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1798 MOVE_STATE "Movement state. 0 = moving away / same direction, 2 = moving toward (oncoming), 1 and 3 = not clearly moving (1 vs 3 unresolved). Pre-registered test on unseen segments: value 0 had over-ground speed > 0.5 m/s on 99.65% of rows, value 2 < -0.5 m/s on 99.88%, values 1/3 |v| < 2 m/s on 89.5% (docs/14).";
