CM_ SG_ 1807 UNK_272_5 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.095 per cycle, 17 distinct values 2..18. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.30. Size / class candidate: camera vehicle height partial rho 0.41-0.71, width 0.36-0.69, truck/bus 0.24-0.39 (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1807 CONST_277_11 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ BO_ 1808 "Reassembled 0x80 object slot 16 (record bytes 593-628), sent only when occupied. Little-endian bit field: bit 0 = LSB of slot byte 0.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 STATE_CODE "Raw lifecycle state. Measured/predicted semantics not proved; not an accuracy gate.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 SLOT_INDEX_CODE "Physical slot index or 63 in unallocated-form headers; verified against slot positions. Not class or reference point.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 UNK_8_6 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.103 per cycle, 32 distinct values 30..62. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.55. Ramps up with age and saturates at 62; tracks range and scenario, not measured error.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 ONCOMING_FLAG "1 = oncoming now or earlier in the track life (persists after an oncoming object slows). Pre-registered test on unseen segments: over-ground speed < 0 on 100% of flagged rows, 88.5% of objects approaching faster than 2 m/s flagged (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1808 CONST_15_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 SCORE_CODE "Bounded score-like byte, not calibrated confidence or percent. Value 100 does not guarantee accurate geometry or velocity.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 AGE "Track age in radar cycles (~60 ms): 1 at birth, saturates at 126; 0 = slot being retired (geometry is the previous occupant's). A restart is a new track. Tracks younger than ~60 carry unconverged range and velocity.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 CONST_31_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 DREL "Longitudinal distance forward of the radar, m. 1/16 m, zero code 160 (exactly -10 m). Camera ground contact at 5-25 m: slope 0.99-1.00 on three drives, zero within 0.2 m (0.7 m on a hilly drive). Settled tracks walk by metres record to record at 40 m+; young tracks can be far off.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 YREL_LEFT "Lateral offset, LEFT positive (openpilot yRel), m. 1/64 m, offset binary around 2048. Cartesian (constant across range), not an angle. Correct side 97.9-99.3% on held-out drives; scale bounded to about +/-10%. |code-2048| >= 2000 is a sentinel.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 UNK_56_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.355 per cycle, 84 distinct values 4..96. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.30. Size / class candidate: per-track median follows camera vehicle height (partial rho 0.48-0.61 at fixed range) and truck/bus class (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1808 CONST_63_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 VLONG_OVER_GROUND "Longitudinal velocity OVER GROUND, m/s. 0.15 m/s/code, zero 510.5. vRel = this - ego speed. Radar-only scale check (own range slope vs GPS ego) gives 0.150/0.149/0.153 on three drives. Beats zero and range differencing against a camera reference, but has unflagged ~1 s excursions at range. Unsettled for age < ~60.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 VLAT_OVER_GROUND_PROV "Lateral velocity over ground, LEFT positive (sign confirmed). Scale NOT pinned: the factor shown (0.15) is a placeholder. Radar-only estimates from its own lateral position change range 0.097-0.147 m/s per code across data sets, and the pre-registered test was unverified. See docs/14.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 ALONG_LIKE_84 "Acceleration-like, zero code 511 at standstill. Follows the VLONG change with a ~0.5 s lag, so it cannot flag or lead a velocity excursion. Radar-only scale about 0.04 m/s^2 per code on most data but drive-dependent (0.03-0.11); centred codes (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1808 CONST_94_2 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 UNK_96 "Unnamed 10-bit carry chain centred near 511; no relation to velocity or range error on three drives.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 UNK_106_1 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.003 per cycle, 2 distinct values 0..1. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.14.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 UNK_107_1 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.013 per cycle, 2 distinct values 0..1. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.24. Coasting-flag candidate: about 0.02 in settled life, 0.5-0.66 just before deletion (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1808 CONST_108_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1808 MOVE_STATE "Movement state. 0 = moving away / same direction, 2 = moving toward (oncoming), 1 and 3 = not clearly moving (1 vs 3 unresolved). Pre-registered test on unseen segments: value 0 had over-ground speed > 0.5 m/s on 99.65% of rows, value 2 < -0.5 m/s on 99.88%, values 1/3 |v| < 2 m/s on 89.5% (docs/14).";
