CM_ SG_ 1808 UNK_216_6 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.150 per cycle, 34 distinct values 3..49. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.23. Size / class candidate: camera vehicle height partial rho 0.44-0.63, truck/bus 0.35-0.42; width on A/C. Compare ARS4-B Length / dZ (6 bits) (docs/14).";
