CM_ SG_ 1808 UNK_224_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.344 per cycle, 127 distinct values 1..127. Strongest correlation: dRel r=+0.80. Uncertainty candidate: scales with range (r~0.8), falls with age at fixed range (rho -0.29 to -0.36), larger when range steps are noisier, rises before deletion. Weak near-range error indicator; does not single out excursions.";
