CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_148_8 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.009 per cycle, 27 distinct values 0..240. Strongest correlation: dRel r=-0.12.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_156_4 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.016 per cycle, 16 distinct values 0..15. Strongest correlation: abs_yRel r=-0.42.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_160_3 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_163_2 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.006 per cycle, 3 distinct values 1..3. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.30.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_165_3 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_168_10 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.066 per cycle, 3 distinct values 0..1023. Strongest correlation: abs_yRel r=+0.14.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_178_3 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_181_1 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.071 per cycle, 2 distinct values 0..1. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=+0.34.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_182_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_183_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.009 per cycle, 24 distinct values 26..73. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.20.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_190_10 "Constant 1 (0x1) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_200_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.023 per cycle, 16 distinct values 0..127. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.45.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_207_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_208_6 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.017 per cycle, 20 distinct values 0..63. Strongest correlation: v_over_ground r=-0.38.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_214_2 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_216_6 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.150 per cycle, 34 distinct values 3..49. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.23. Size / class candidate: camera vehicle height partial rho 0.44-0.63, truck/bus 0.35-0.42; width on A/C. Compare ARS4-B Length / dZ (6 bits) (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_222_2 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_224_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.344 per cycle, 127 distinct values 1..127. Strongest correlation: dRel r=+0.80. Uncertainty candidate: scales with range (r~0.8), falls with age at fixed range (rho -0.29 to -0.36), larger when range steps are noisier, rises before deletion. Weak near-range error indicator; does not single out excursions.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_231_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_232_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.096 per cycle, 72 distinct values 0..127. Strongest correlation: abs_yRel r=+0.60. Lateral-uncertainty candidate: scales with |yRel| (r~0.6), falls with age at fixed range (rho -0.50 to -0.59).";
CM_ SG_ 1810 PER_TRACK_239_1 "Constant within a track, differs between tracks (2 values 0..1): object attribute candidate, unverified. Strongest correlation: abs_yRel r=+0.09.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_240_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.364 per cycle, 127 distinct values 1..127. Strongest correlation: dRel r=+0.80. Velocity-uncertainty candidate (like ARS408 VrelLong_rms): scales with range, falls with age, rises before deletion. Flags velocity glitches: stratified AUC 0.65 / 0.85 (discovery / confirmation) against clean labels where native vRel disagrees with both the radar ACC target (0x235) and vision (docs/15). Decoded as vel_unc_code.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_247_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_248_7 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.116 per cycle, 97 distinct values 0..127. Strongest correlation: abs_yRel r=+0.56. Uncertainty candidate: scales with |yRel| (r~0.56), falls with age at fixed range (rho -0.70 to -0.75).";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_255_1 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_256_5 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.177 per cycle, 30 distinct values 0..30. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.72. Existence / confidence candidate: rises with age at fixed range (rho +0.86 to +0.90), drops about 1.5 codes before deletion. Compare ARS4-B ProbExist (5 bits).";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_261_3 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_264_4 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.100 per cycle, 16 distinct values 0..15. Strongest correlation: age r=-0.81. 4 live bits by carry chain (bit 268 constant). Young tracks: counts down with age (13 at age 2 to ~5 at age 80). Settled tracks: values 1-4 depend on range (4 ~10 m, 3 ~12 m, 1 ~30 m, 2 ~47 m), consistent with a near-scan / far-scan measurement state (unconfirmed semantics). Value 1 is more common during velocity glitches (stratified AUC 0.69 / 0.63).";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_268_4 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 1810 UNK_272_5 "Candidate from the carry-chain split, unverified: LSB flips 0.095 per cycle, 17 distinct values 2..18. Strongest correlation: age r=+0.30. Size / class candidate: camera vehicle height partial rho 0.41-0.71, width 0.36-0.69, truck/bus 0.24-0.39 (docs/14).";
CM_ SG_ 1810 CONST_277_11 "Constant 0 (0x0) in every record observed: reserved/padding or configuration.";
CM_ BO_ 1811 "Reassembled 0x80 object slot 19 (record bytes 701-736), sent only when occupied. Little-endian bit field: bit 0 = LSB of slot byte 0.";
