CM_ BO_ 1824 "NOT radar bytes: values the ars510 interface computes for 0x80 slot 0, for plotting next to the raw fields.";
CM_ SG_ 1824 TRACK_ID_OP "trackId openpilot would see under OPENPILOT_CONFIG (held until age 60, re-link within 3.5 s); 0 when not published.";
CM_ SG_ 1824 TRACK_ID_RAW "trackId from the radar slot/age lifecycle alone (RAW_CONFIG).";
CM_ SG_ 1824 VREL "VLONG_OVER_GROUND - Toyota 0xB4 speed, m/s.";
CM_ SG_ 1824 V_EGO_0xB4 "Toyota 0xB4 SPEED used for VREL, m/s (reads ~1.5% below GPS / wheel speed).";
CM_ SG_ 1824 DREL_FUSED "Candidate, not in OPENPILOT_CONFIG: velocity-aided range (gain 0.1); halves short-term range walks vs the camera.";
CM_ SG_ 1824 VREL_SMOOTHED "Candidate, not in OPENPILOT_CONFIG: causal EMA on VREL, tau 0 s below 30 m rising to 1 s from 60 m; ~0.5 s later true braking.";
CM_ BO_ 1825 "NOT radar bytes: values the ars510 interface computes for 0x80 slot 1, for plotting next to the raw fields.";
CM_ SG_ 1825 TRACK_ID_OP "trackId openpilot would see under OPENPILOT_CONFIG (held until age 60, re-link within 3.5 s); 0 when not published.";
CM_ SG_ 1825 TRACK_ID_RAW "trackId from the radar slot/age lifecycle alone (RAW_CONFIG).";
CM_ SG_ 1825 VREL "VLONG_OVER_GROUND - Toyota 0xB4 speed, m/s.";
